+t: procedure
+  parse arg code, show
+  signal on syntax
+  f.0 = 'unset'
+  interpret code
+  say 'returned' result 'f.0' f.0
+  return
+syntax:
+  o = condition('o')
+  extra = ''
+  if show == 'b' then extra = 'b~items' b~items
+  say o~code o~message '| f.0' f.0 extra
